[{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0033","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0033.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0901","title":"AMANDA 多缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"AMANDA（Advanced Maryland Automatic Network Disk Archiver）2.3.0.4 版本中存在多处缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向 amindexd 守护进程发送超长命令触发溢出，导致任意代码执行；本地用户亦可利用 amcheck、amgetidx、amtrmidx、createindex-dump、createindex-gnutar 等工具的超长命令行参数触发溢出，实现权限提升或任意代码执行。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重，受影响系统需尽快升级至修复版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0901"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-10-04T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:21.380","remediation":"立即升级 AMANDA 至 3.5.3 或更高版本，该漏洞在后续版本中已修复。如无法升级，在防火墙层面限制对 amindexd 服务（默认端口 10080）的访问，仅允许可信备份客户端连接，并限制本地非授权用户对 amcheck、amgetidx 等 SUID 程序的执行权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/274215","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9181.php","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9182.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4836","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4840","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9342e5394ee109ffc3617b5105797cdfcfcb78cf/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0901.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0901","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2002-0901.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4591185d8ea1fe47b6e30df3286bd52753a931ce/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0901.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-4ff8-c98x-v6m4/GHSA-4ff8-c98x-v6m4.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x5000/4836/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_149100_149200.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0901.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--6fde668a-4a7c-4c87-a416-383882d2768d.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0033.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0032","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0032.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0896","title":"Swatch 日志监控工具抑制事件报告漏洞","description":"Swatch（Simple Watcher）日志监控工具的抑制（throttle）机制存在逻辑缺陷，当同一类型事件在抑制周期结束后再次出现，或匹配同一 \"watchfor\" 表达式的多个事件未在抑制周期内连续发生时，抑制模块可能无法正常上报这些事件。远程攻击者可利用此缺陷，通过精心安排攻击事件的时间间隔来绕过日志告警系统的检测，从而隐藏恶意行为不被发现。该漏洞影响 Swatch 日志监控系统的告警完整性，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0896"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-10-04T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:20.830","remediation":"升级到 Swatch 3.0 以上版本或迁移至其继任者 swatchdog（最新版 3.2.3），该版本已修复 throttle 抑制事件报告的缺陷。如无法升级，可在 Swatch 配置中增大 throttle_period 参数值并避免在同一个 watchfor 表达式中匹配多条规则，同时启用多个独立 throttle 实例分别监控不同事件类型以降低漏报风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/272582","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9100.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4746","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9342e5394ee109ffc3617b5105797cdfcfcb78cf/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0896.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0896","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2002-0896.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4591185d8ea1fe47b6e30df3286bd52753a931ce/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0896.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2q4j-p6fg-wmfg/GHSA-2q4j-p6fg-wmfg.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0896.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_149100_149200.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--dc98e45b-d429-49b6-9b99-c3a86722063e.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x5000/4746/info.html","https://github.com/masterfabric/masterfabric-pre-release/blob/d9d6f5c519248b656db787087e36b71c4b7a8ee9/cases/reports/nextjs_security_report.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0032.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0001","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0001.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1131","title":"SquirrelMail 1.2.7 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"SquirrelMail 1.2.7 及更早版本中存在多个跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 addressbook.php、options.php、search.php 或 help.php 等页面提交特制的恶意参数触发该漏洞，导致恶意脚本代码在其他用户的浏览器中执行，从而窃取会话 Cookie、劫持用户会话或冒充用户执行任意操作。攻击无需身份认证，仅需诱使用户点击特制链接即可触发，影响面较广。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1131"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2002-10-04T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:47.023","remediation":"升级 SquirrelMail 至 1.2.8 或更高版本，该版本修复了 addressbook.php、options.php、search.php、help.php 等文件中的输入过滤缺失问题。同时建议在 Web 服务器（如 Apache）层面启用 mod_security 规则，对用户输入参数进行严格的 HTML 编码过滤，防范跨站脚本攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-09/0246.html","http://sourceforge.net/project/shownotes.php?group_id=311&release_id=110774","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-191","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10145.php","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-204.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5763","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21811","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2002/CVE-2002-1131.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/a90de4f84b4783951362f491671e1e9decfc17cb/2002/CVE-2002-1131.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/a5c2e8e4dab8c8e618ba76807c3e07587b7d781a/http/cves/2002/CVE-2002-1131.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2002-1131-1302.yaml","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/CVE-2002-1131_7.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d5838f491a2d04e9f823fb9638e9e6f0b038d399/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1131.json","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder3/cve-2002-1131-1303.yaml","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/5001-to-6000-templates/cve-2002-1131-1301.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2002-1131.js","https://github.com/itsmenaga/Nuclei-Templates-All/blob/7e93c24e44969db15f4072e1c6a322a026452d6b/Vulnerability-Templates/cve-2002-1131-1301.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2002-1131-1302.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0001.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0106","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0106.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1593","title":"Apache HTTP Server mod_dav 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Apache HTTP Server 2.0.41 及更早版本中的 mod_dav 模块未能正确处理版本控制钩子（versioning hooks），存在空指针解引用漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过发送特制的 WebDAV 请求触发空指针解引用，导致 Apache 子进程崩溃，在 preforked 多进程模式下引发 CPU 资源耗尽，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Apache HTTP Server 2.0.41 及之前版本，升级至 2.0.42 及以上版本可修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1593"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-09-25T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:37.033","remediation":"立即将 Apache HTTP Server 升级至 2.0.42 或更新版本，此版本修复了 mod_dav 处理 versioning hooks 时存在的空指针解引用缺陷。如无法立即升级，可在 httpd.conf 中注释或移除 LoadModule dav_module modules/mod_dav.so 行以禁用 WebDAV 功能，缓解拒绝服务攻击风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://securitytracker.com/id?1005285","http://www.apache.org/dist/httpd/CHANGES_2.0","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/406121","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5816","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10208","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/54a42d4b01968df1117cea77fc53d6beb931c0e05936ad02af93e9ac%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/5df9bfb86a3b054bb985a45ff9250b0332c9ecc181eec232489e7f79%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r0276683d8e1e07153fc8642618830ac0ade85b9ae0dc7b07f63bb8fc%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r2cb985de917e7da0848c440535f65a247754db8b2154a10089e4247b%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r5001ecf3d6b2bdd0b732e527654248abb264f08390045d30709a92f6%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r7035b7c9091c4b665a3b7205364775410646f12125d48e74e395f2ce%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r8828e649175df56f1f9e3919938ac7826128525426e2748f0ab62feb%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r9e8622254184645bc963a1d47c5d47f6d5a36d6f080d8d2c43b2b142%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r9f93cf6dde308d42a9c807784e8102600d0397f5f834890708bf6920%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/rd00b45b93fda4a5bd013b2858