在多处缓冲区溢出漏洞。该漏洞源于程序在处理游戏高分记录等数据时未正确验证输入长度，导致缓冲区溢出。本地攻击者可利用该漏洞以游戏进程权限执行任意代码，从而提升权限并篡改高分榜数据。攻击条件为拥有本地系统访问权限，无需额外认证，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1124"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-09-24T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:46.310","remediation":"建议立即升级 purity 至 1-16 或更高版本。Debian 用户应通过 apt upgrade 安装 purity 1-14.2（woody）或更新版本。如无法升级，建议限制本地非信任用户访问系统以降低利用风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-166","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10100.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5702","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/377bb49f7479dd297ab5004f75a37c291a136578/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1124.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1124","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2002-1124.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1b84eedba993546f37a880c6d2d084176a1f04a7/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1124.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-166.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ad1f28a6575460b2b8dc02e086c9a35eb31ea1f4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-76mc-v2gg-8554/GHSA-76mc-v2gg-8554.json","https://github.com/zercurity/vulnerabilities/blob/8eb5f158d91688a46557263c708774d5f8d3956c/2002/CVE-2002-1124","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x6000/5702/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1124.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_149100_149200.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0040.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0031","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0031.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0875","title":"SGI IRIX FAM 任意根目录文件列表漏洞","description":"FAM（File Alteration Monitor）2.6.8及更早版本中存在文件列表泄露漏洞。由于对根目录所属文件的访问控制检查不充分，本地低权限攻击者可利用该漏洞列出本应仅限 root 用户或 root 组访问的敏感文件名称，导致系统敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响 SGI IRIX 6.5.x 等操作系统平台，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低，攻击前提为拥有本地系统访问权限。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0875"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-09-05T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:18.583","remediation":"将 FAM 升级至 2.7.0 或更高版本（此版本修复了根目录文件列表泄露问题）。对于已停止维护的旧系统，建议替换为 Gamin 作为 FAM 替代方案，或通过 xinetd 限制 FAM 服务的访问来源（仅允许本机回环地址连接），同时在 /etc/fam.conf 中将 `allow_all` 设为 `false` 以禁止非特权用户查询受限目录。若无法升级，可将敏感目录从 FAM 监控范围中排除。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-154","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9880.php","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2005-005.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5487","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21720","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9342e5394ee109ffc3617b5105797cdfcfcb78cf/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0875.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0875","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2002-0875.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4591185d8ea1fe47b6e30df3286bd52753a931ce/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0875.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-mcf7-9m9g-x48v/GHSA-mcf7-9m9g-x48v.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/redhat-RHSA-2005-005.nasl","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-154.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--6f371e81-1f20-4561-8e53-69c2d2689e9a.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0875.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0031.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0030","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0030.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0871","title":"Xinetd xinetd 信号管道文件描述符泄露拒绝服务漏洞","description":"xinetd 2.3.4 版本中存在文件描述符泄露漏洞，当 xinetd 启动子服务时，信号管道的文件描述符未正确关闭，导致被子服务继承。本地攻击者可通过操作继承的文件描述符向信号管道写入数据，触发 xinetd 进程异常行为，最终造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响使用 xinetd 超级守护进程的各类 Unix/Linux 系统，攻击者需拥有本地访问权限，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0871"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-09-05T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:18.137","remediation":"升级 xinetd 至 2.3.5 或更高版本，该版本已修复信号管道文件描述符泄漏问题。如无法升级，可在 xinetd 配置中禁用不必要的服务，并通过 iptables 限制对受影响服务的访问以降低风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102935383506155&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9844.php","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2002/MDKSA-2002-053.php","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-196.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-228.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5458","https://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-151","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/362345baaa3b0376b2369a7901885756e250334b/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0871.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0871","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-