super 命令（William Deich Super 3.x 版本）存在格式字符串漏洞，本地用户可通过向该命令传递包含格式说明符的长命令行参数触发该漏洞，导致以 root 权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Super 3.x 全版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，利用难度较低。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0817"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:11.560","remediation":"立即升级 super 至 3.12 或更高版本，该版本已修复 syslog() 调用中的格式字符串漏洞。如无法升级，可移除 super 的 setuid 位（chmod u-s /usr/bin/super）作为临时缓解，仅允许受信用户执行。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2002-q3/0045.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102812622416695&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-139","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9741.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5367","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21674","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2002/CVE-2002-0817.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/34b929f9979d6d9d9584dfab31f29f50dcf08e3f/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0817.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0817","https://github.com/greenbone/openvas-scanner/blob/06e41f93127a6d73156d142f0cda0425eca32d69/rust/examples/feed/notus/advisories/windows.notus","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4591185d8ea1fe47b6e30df3286bd52753a931ce/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0817.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-0817.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-8fq5-cc29-prwp/GHSA-8fq5-cc29-prwp.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-139.nasl","https://github.com/SAP/fosstars-rating-core/blob/7b172f42f218f6cfad42f81bd9c9ef49de35b919/docs/oss/security/apache/superset.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0024.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0023","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0023.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0765","title":"OpenBSD OpenSSH 身份验证绕过漏洞","description":"OpenSSH 3.2.2 的 sshd 组件在使用 YP（NIS）和 netgroup 机制时存在认证实现缺陷。当系统配置了基于 YP 的 netgroup 访问控制时，在某些特定条件下，远程攻击者能够使用其他用户的密码通过身份验证并成功登录目标系统，导致认证绕过。该漏洞影响 OpenSSH 3.2.2 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高，攻击者无需事先认证即可利用此漏洞获取系统非授权访问。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0765"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:05.520","remediation":"升级 OpenSSH 至 3.3 及以上版本，该漏洞在 OpenSSH 3.3 中已修复。如无法升级，可禁用 YP/NIS netgroups 认证方式，在 `/etc/ssh/sshd_config` 中设置 `UsePAM yes` 并移除 NIS netgroup 相关配置作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-05/0235.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9215.php","http://www.openbsd.org/errata.html#sshbsdauth","http://www.osvdb.org/5113","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4803","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/34b929f9979d6d9d9584dfab31f29f50dcf08e3f/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0765.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0765","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2002-0765.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4591185d8ea1fe47b6e30df3286bd52753a931ce/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0765.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-hw3r-x5qh-749j/GHSA-hw3r-x5qh-749j.json","https://github.com/zercurity/vulnerabilities/blob/8eb5f158d91688a46557263c708774d5f8d3956c/2002/CVE-2002-0765","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/O/openssh_33.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_148900_149000.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0765.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0023.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0022","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0022.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0740","title":"SLRN slrnpull SPOOLDIR 命令行参数缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"SLRN 软件包中的 slrnpull 组件存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。当 slrnpull 以 setuid 或 setgid 权限安装时，本地攻击者可通过向 -d（SPOOLDIR）参数传递超长字符串触发缓冲区溢出，从而获取目标系统的提升权限。该漏洞影响 SLRN 0.9.6 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限方可利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0740"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:02.783","remediation":"升级 slrn 至 0.9.8.0 或更高版本（最新版为 1.0.1），可从 SourceForge 获取源码编译安装，或通过系统包管理器更新。如无法升级，执行 `chmod u-s /usr/bin/slrnpull && chmod g-s /usr/bin/slrnpull` 移除 slrnpull 的 setuid/setgid 权限位，以消除本地提权攻击路径；若无需 NNTP 拉取功能，可直接卸载 slrnpull 软件包。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-04/0302.html","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/269667","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/270235","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8910.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4569","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21408","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2002/CVE-2002-0740.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/c2df87babf8eed88f612cb73e25ef1a25c924358/2002/CVE-2002-0740.json","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/dc4a87067238e8e55e5d3f9777b54558310f6d6e/2002/CVE-2002-0740/README.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0740","https://github.com/diannaofengzi/POC/blob/14d504f7488db9229f6f02be54aab53e3cfee0dc/databases/2002/database/CVE-2002-0740/CVE-2002-0740-alt3kx.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/475f53ac063af305fc146a443cce993188109d56/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0740.json","https://github.com/ycdxsb/PocOrExp_in_Github/blob/706c16a4787d37bf8dcd30da5df424ea091c303e/2002/README.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-f324-877p-jh9x/GHSA-f324-877p-jh9x.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2002-0740.md","https://github.com/0xT11/CVE-POC/blob/2b6f11c3712c0efb88ac3edeab3d0aafa1f7a090/2002/CVE-2002-0740.json","https://github.com/alt3kx/CVE-2002-0740"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0022.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0021","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0021.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0738","title":"MHonArc 邮件归档跨站脚本漏洞","description":"MHonArc 2.5.2 及更早版本的电子邮件归档功能未正确过滤邮件中的恶意 JavaScript 代码，存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。远程攻击者可通过构造特殊邮件，利用 SCRIPT 标签拆分、IMG 标签 SRC 属性注入或 `&={script}` 语法等方式绕过过滤，当其他用户查看归档邮件时触发恶意脚本执行。该漏洞影响 MHonArc 2.5.2 及之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。建议升级至更高版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0738"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:02.557","remediation":"升级 MHonArc 至 2.5.3 或更高版本（2.5.14 为安全修复版），Debian 用户安装对应安全更新（DSA-163）。如无法升级，在 MHonArc 配置中通过 MIMEEXCS 资源禁用 text/html 邮件处理以阻止 HTML 脚本执行，同时在 Web 服务器层面设置 Content-Security-Policy 头限制脚本加载作为纵深防御。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-04/0260.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-163","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8894.php","http://www.mhonarc.org/MHonArc/CHANGES","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4546","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/34b929f9979d6d9d9584dfab31f29f50dcf08e3f/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0738.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0738","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2002-0738.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/475f53ac063af305fc146a443cce993188109d56/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0738.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-mqj3-hp36-pg28/GHSA-mqj3-hp36-pg28.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-163.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_600_700.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/debiancn/debian.org/blob/6abc98daa6356b20e410013a6920b3764af682d4/english/security/2002/dsa-163.data","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0738.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0021.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0021.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0016","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0016.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0684","title":"GNU glibc DNS解析器缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"glibc 2.2.5 及更早版本的 DNS 解析器函数存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，该漏洞源自 BIND 4.9.8 中移植的用于网络名称和地址查询的子程序。远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的 DNS 响应数据包，在调用 getnetbyname 或 getnetbyaddr 等函数时触发缓冲区溢出，导致任意代码执行。该漏洞影响使用受影响 glibc 版本的 Linux 系统，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0684"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:56.450","remediation":"将 glibc 升级至 2.3.0 及以上版本，该漏洞在 2.2.5 及更早版本中存在。对于使用 BIND 4.9.8 的系统，应升级至 BIND 8.x/9.x 系列。如暂时无法升级，可在 DNS 解析器层面限制仅向可信 DNS 服务器发起查询，或禁用不需要的 getnetbyname/getnetbyaddr 等函数调用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000507","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102581482511612&w=2","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2002-139.html","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/542971","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2002/MDKSA-2002-050.php","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2002/CVE-2002-0029.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/34b929f9979d6d9d9584dfab31f29f50dcf08e3f/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0684.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0684","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2002-0684.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/475f53ac063af305fc146a443cce993188109d56/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0684.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-wc7g-r6mj-mjf6/GHSA-wc7g-r6mj-mjf6.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/mandrake_MDKSA-2002-050.nasl","https://github.com/NetBSD/pkgsrc-wip/blob/97a17708b9a16c731a8a37abc74c9e94d43d7b3f/sara/PLIST","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/B/bind9_overflow.nasl","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380